---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Privacy Policy | Neat Squad"
description: "Neat Squad's privacy policy explaining how we collect, use, and protect information submitted through our website."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    {% set crumbs = [{label: "Privacy Policy"}] %}
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lede">Last updated: {% year %}</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <div class="notice-box">This is a starting-point privacy policy template, not legal advice. Have it reviewed by a lawyer familiar with Canadian privacy law (PIPEDA) before publishing live.</div>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit a quote request or contact form on this site, we collect the information you provide, such as your name, phone number, email address, city, and details about the service you're requesting.</p>
    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>We use the information you provide solely to respond to your inquiry, prepare a quote, and schedule and deliver requested services. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
    <h2>Data storage</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are processed through our website hosting provider's form-handling service. We retain contact information only as long as needed to respond to your request and maintain our business records.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not use tracking or advertising cookies by default. If analytics tools are added in the future, this policy will be updated to reflect them.</p>
    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this policy or want your information removed from our records, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
